My Umbraco 17 site is occasionally showing content or session data that belongs to a different user. I suspect it's a caching or concurrency issue. Here's the controller we're using:

```csharp
public class SearchController : Controller
{
    private static UmbracoHelper _helper;

    public SearchController(IUmbracoHelperAccessor accessor)
    {
        if (_helper is null)
        {
            accessor.TryGetUmbracoHelper(out var h);
            _helper = h;
        }
    }

    public IActionResult Index(string q)
    {
        var results = _helper.ContentAtRoot().Where(x => x.Name.Contains(q));
        return View(results);
    }
}
```

What's wrong and how do I fix it?

